WEBVTT

00:05:56.753 --> 00:06:00.268
working to protect and restore
this magnificent planet.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.387
Every bit of habitat we preserve,

00:06:04.411 --> 00:06:07.609
every tenth of a degree
of warming we prevent,

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:09.331
really does matter.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.534
Thankfully, I'm not motivated by hope,

00:06:12.558 --> 00:06:14.758
but rather a desire to be useful.

00:06:15.558 --> 00:06:19.690
Because I don't know
how to give an honest talk

00:06:19.714 --> 00:06:23.087
about my beloved parrotfish
and coral reefs

00:06:23.111 --> 00:06:24.711
that has a happy ending.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.191
Thank you.

00:06:26.215 --> 00:06:29.213
(Applause)